participant student Student
participant address Address
participant professor Professor

call student address validate
return address student bool

alt addressValid
call student address outputAsLabel
return address student str
else
self student getSeminarsTaken
return student student int
end

loop repeatEnrollmentCheck
self student isEligibleToEnroll
return student student bool
end

call professor student getSeminarsTaken
return student professor int

self student purchaseParkingPass
return student student confirmation